Package: cursorpop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libx11-6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxext6, python3 (>= 3.6), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: Esteban Cerutti <esteban.cerutti@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ecerutti/cursorpop
Description: Animated cursor effects for X11
 CursorPop shrinks the cursor on click (macOS style) and grows it when you
 shake the mouse to find it on screen.
 It ships a C daemon and a GTK GUI with a system tray icon.
